                <invention-title lang="de">SYSTEME, VERFAHREN UND GRAFISCHE BENUTZEROBERFLÄCHEN ZUR ANZEIGE UND MANIPULATION VIRTUELLER OBJEKTE IN UMGEBUNGEN DER ERWEITERTEN REALITÄT</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">SYSTÈMES, PROCÉDÉS ET INTERFACES UTILISATEUR GRAPHIQUES POUR AFFICHER ET MANIPULER DES OBJETS VIRTUELS DANS DES ENVIRONNEMENTS DE RÉALITÉ AUGMENTÉE</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">SYSTEMS, METHODS, AND GRAPHICAL USER INTERFACES FOR DISPLAYING AND MANIPULATING VIRTUAL OBJECTS IN AUGMENTED REALITY ENVIRONMENTS</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A computer system displays a virtual object in a view of a physical environment that includes physical objects. The virtual object is displayed at a first position with a spatial relationship to a first physical object. The computer system detects a user input. If the user input requests to move the virtual object to a position having the spatial relationship to the first physical object, the computer system moves the virtual object with movements corresponding to the user input. If the user input requests to move the first virtual object to a position having the spatial relationship to the second physical object, the computer system displays an animation of the virtual object moving to the location the predefined spatial relationship to the second physical object, which includes moving the virtual object with movement that does not correspond to the user input.</p>
            </abstract>
